== Trivia ==
* It grants the fourth highest amount of base {{Stat|scc}} in the game, at {{Green|2.5%}} per piece and {{Green|10%}} total. It also grants the highest  {{Stat|scc}} out of fishing sets that can be obtained from water fishing, with the higher tiers of armor, {{Item|Lava Sea Creature Armor}}, {{Item|Thunder Armor}} and {{Item|Magma Lord Armor}} only being obtained through lava fishing.
* Wearing the full set will unlock the {{ach|Absorb it all!|ach=true}} which normally unlocks by wearing full set of [[Sponge Armor]].
* There used to be a bug where if a player wears {{Item|Sponge Armor}} or '''Shark Scale Armor''' in water, then switches to another armor set while still in the water, they can gain the {{stat|def|2x}} buff even if they are not wearing {{Item|Sponge Armor|link=}} or '''Shark Scale Armor'''.
* If the player wears this set and has a {{Skl|fishing}} level of less than 24, the {{Fsb}} {{AN|Absorb}} still doubles the player's {{Stat|defense}}.

